  a0 fixed at 9.362e-11: least-scatter Upsilon_disc = 0.54, rms = 0.143 dex;   fixed at 1.131e-10: 0.48, 0.144 dex
  ESTIMATOR B, shape-only (free vertical offset):
                   Ups_bul = 0.6   Ups_bul = 0.7   Ups_bul = 0.8
