  d log10 a0/dz = -0.0924 +/- 0.0636 (bootstrap);  constant: 0 (-1.5 sigma);  halo-emergent mean slope +0.1311 (-3.5 sigma);  H(z) mean slope +0.2304 (-5.1 sigma)
  matched comparators (OLS at RC100's redshifts): halo law (1e12 Msun) +0.1532, H(z) +0.2246  (formal distances 3.9 and 5.0 sigma, conditional on RC100's mass models; NOT quoted)
