  controlling for log y_hat (absorbs noise AND part of any real signal): +0.020 +/- 0.048   -> 2.3 sigma
  weakest exclusion of the H(z) mean slope over the three treatments: 4.4 sigma
  range of the redshift slope over the three treatments: -0.12 to +0.02;  weakest exclusion of the halo-emergent slope: 2.3 sigma
